  "ACERCA_BODY_HTML": "<div style='font-size: 11px; color: #DDDDDD; line-height: 1.5;'>PaintNotNet is a simple yet powerful image editing and design software, developed for Linux and inspired by classic Paint.NET.<br><br>It offers key features for image editing, such as layer management, action history, and the ability to save your projects to continue at any time.<br><br>Developed in Python assisted by <b>Google Gemini</b> and <b>Google Antigravity</b>.<br><br><b>Author:</b> Adrian &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>X:</b> <a href='https://www.x.com/adrian_and_ino' style='color: #64B4FF; text-decoration: underline;'>@adrian_and_ino</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <b>GitHub:</b> <a href='https://github.com/adrianandin0/PaintNotNet/' style='color: #64B4FF; text-decoration: underline;'>PaintNotNet Repository</a><br><br>The project is under constant development. Everyone is welcome to contribute or report bugs.<br><br><b>Icon and Graphic Resource Credits:</b><br><a href='https://www.flaticon.com/' style='color: #64B4FF; text-decoration: underline;'>Flaticon</a> &bull; <a href='https://www.flaticon.com/authors/magnific' style='color: #64B4FF; text-decoration: underline;'>Magnific</a> &bull; <a href='https://www.flaticon.com/authors/uniconlabs' style='color: #64B4FF; text-decoration: underline;'>Uniconlabs</a> &bull; <a href='https://www.flaticon.com/authors/balraj-chana' style='color: #64B4FF; text-decoration: underline;'>Balraj Chana</a> &bull; <a href='https://www.flaticon.com/authors/gajah-mada' style='color: #64B4FF; text-decoration: underline;'>Gajah Mada</a></div>"
